<Layout title="Kin & Campus | A local doctor for them">
<div class="w hero2"><div><div class="eyebrow">Concierge medicine for Virginia Tech students</div><h1>A local doctor for them. Peace of mind for you.</h1><p class="lead">A board certified physician right here in Blacksburg-- looking after them the years they are away from you on campus.</p><p class="hero-cta"><a class="btn" href={href("join")}>Reserve a spot</a><a class="lnk" href={href("parents")}>For parents &rarr;</a><a class="lnk" href={href("students")}>For students &rarr;</a></p></div>
<img class="art" src={href("photos/drillfield-fall.jpg")} width="678" height="452" alt="Fall leaves on the Drillfield, Burruss Hall across the green">
</div>
<div class="w"><div class="trust"><div><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg><b>A number they actually have</b><span>Direct text access to their doctor in town—no call centers, no triage lines.</span></div><div><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg><b>Same-day in Blacksburg</b><span>Just eight minutes from campus, with a strictly limited panel so same-day visits are always available.</span></div><div><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg><b>You stay in the loop</b><span>Your hometown doctor is designated on day one, and you establish the communication boundaries together.</span></div></div></div>
<section><div class="w split"><div><div class="eyebrow">For parents</div><h2>They're far from home. We are local.</h2><p>What every parent wants is a trusted physician nearby. A board-certified pediatrician who checks in around midterms and holidays, and keeps the doctor who has known them since kindergarten fully informed.</p><p><a class="lnk" href={href("parents")}>How we look after them &rarr;</a></p></div>
<svg class="art" viewBox="0 0 600 190" role="img" aria-label="You, Kin and Campus, and your student, connected"><path d="M112 80Q190 10 265 66M335 66Q410 10 488 80" fill="none" stroke="#C9A24B" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="2 10" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="70" cy="82" r="42" fill="#6B2737"/><circle cx="70" cy="70" r="12" fill="#F6EFE4"/><path d="M46 104q24-26 48 0z" fill="#F6EFE4"/><circle cx="530" cy="82" r="42" fill="#C9A24B"/><circle cx="530" cy="70" r="12" fill="#2A1A1E"/><path d="M506 104q24-26 48 0z" fill="#2A1A1E"/><circle cx="300" cy="78" r="40" fill="#9CAF98"/><path d="M272 84L300 58 328 84v22H272z" fill="#FBF7F0" stroke="#6B2737" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="293" y="90" width="14" height="16" fill="#C9A24B"/><g font-family="DM Sans,sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="currentColor" text-anchor="middle"><text x="70" y="150">You</text><text x="300" y="150">Kin &amp; Campus</text><text x="530" y="150">Your student</text></g></svg></div></section>
<section style="padding-top:0"><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">What a parent wants, in town</div><h2>Four things we hold while they're here.</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Seamless chronic care</h3><p>Their established care plan stays active. We manage ongoing prescriptions, navigate holidays and finals, and update you when things shift.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">2</div><h3>A trained eye in town</h3><p>A local pediatrician living right here in Blacksburg—watching out for them the way you would if you were just eight minutes away.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Building adult health habits</h3><p>College is where healthcare transitions from parents managing the details to young adults owning it. We help them learn how to navigate appointments and care on their own.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Aligned care</h3><p>Student, physician, and parents working together. We talk things through in the room, keeping you and their hometown doctor connected.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">Once you join</div><h2>A parent starts. The student keeps the number.</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>You reach out</h3><p>Tell us who is heading to Blacksburg, and we'll set up an introductory call. No intake forms hidden behind generic portals.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>They meet their doctor</h3><p>An unhurried initial visit in town to establish a genuine relationship before classes kick into gear.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>The number is theirs</h3><p>Direct text access from then on. Same-day care when issues arise, plus intentional check-ins around high-stress windows.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">Privacy</div><h2>Privacy respected. Parents kept in the loop.</h2><p>Once your student turns 18, their medical chart legally belongs to them. Before care begins, we establish a clear communication agreement together so you aren't left in the dark—while respecting their privacy as an adult. Plus, their hometown doctor receives a clinical update the very same day. <a class="lnk2" href={href("privacy")}>How sharing works &rarr;</a></p></div></section>
<section><div class="w"><h2>Built for them. Backed for you.</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>For your student</h3><p>A trusted, unhurried local doctor in Blacksburg who treats them like an adult, respects their privacy, and is just a text message away when life gets busy.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>For you</h3><p>The absolute peace of mind that comes from knowing a board-certified pediatrician is looking out for their health, keeping their hometown care plan intact, and looping you in when it matters.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section><div class="w" style="text-align:center"><h2>One unnecessary ER trip could be more costly than our membership fee.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin:16px auto 28px">College health emergencies rarely happen during convenient business hours. A midnight panic over a high fever, a bad asthma flare, or a severe allergic reaction often sends students straight to the emergency room—where an average visit easily clears thousands of dollars out-of-pocket, even with high deductible insurance.</p><a class="btn" href={href("join")}>Reserve a spot</a></div></section>
</Layout>
